  items.push(`\nWeek 4 · Review and lock the next cycle\n• Compare actual spending with this month's baseline and budget.\n• Keep reductions focused on categories explicitly marked flexible or transactions you have personally confirmed are optional.\n• Move only the surplus that remains after bills and buffer needs into the chosen goal or reserve.`);
